{
  "work_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox",
  "source_path": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0000",
      "source_sha256": "ae8589515085daad",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If the fox—that is, you, the slave of Mammon—does not cry out in a loud voice, the lion—that is, I, the slave of Christ—will be silent."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0001",
      "source_sha256": "1bbc3429ce4999ff",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I know that you are not fighting against me, but against Jesus, who lives among the Christians."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0002",
      "source_sha256": "9115da8fb0014904",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus, in turn, is a match for you and your father, the devil, who lives in you and in whom you place your hope."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0003",
      "source_sha256": "7f67b50aea1f86f0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They, for their part, together with their father who lives in them, Jesus, in whom they place their trust."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0004",
      "source_sha256": "930af1303df6d7f0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "No one who has Jesus will ever be put to shame, as you said."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0005",
      "source_sha256": "2022947a85d13752",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The shame of this world and the glory of this world—I have renounced them both, for I know what I am waiting for."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0006",
      "source_sha256": "490cb0e6e6214019",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Those who have glory and honor from Jesus—what use do they have for human glory and honor?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0007",
      "source_sha256": "013521398c80561b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For just as there is no thievery among those who truly have Jesus, contrary to what you said against me, that I took your gods in a robbery,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0008",
      "source_sha256": "bba4cae8a92cfbfe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and that I had your disgrace and shame bound to the doorposts of your house,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0009",
      "source_sha256": "3ab32d908c8c5338",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "written on sheets of papyrus, with your urine in jars poured out like wine over the lintels of your house, and into your mouth and the mouths of those like you,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0010",
      "source_sha256": "00c567017c2e4706",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so there is no freedom among those who trust in Cronus—that is, you and those who resemble you in unbelief and every kind of impurity."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0011",
      "source_sha256": "7fa6293561802ab1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What deed or what word among the things you have said does not testify against you that you belong to Satan?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0012",
      "source_sha256": "6e35892d367fb449",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It was the letters that you tore up. Or did I not know, before I sent them, that you would tear them up?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0013",
      "source_sha256": "a89eeecc1c0d7cde",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You accomplice of those who cut up with a scribe’s knife the pages of the book containing the words that the prophets sent them in God’s name,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0014",
      "source_sha256": "09a500ee8c0a6958",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and threw them into the burning coals!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0015",
      "source_sha256": "323de2e6dbe4030f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Likewise, you also said, “The people and my stewards bring him things.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0016",
      "source_sha256": "1dd44bc039146bdd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You are telling us and exposing your wickedness: you did not want God’s children to bring an offering to his church,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0017",
      "source_sha256": "ea8984d6c762b817",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "or to do a single good thing in the name of Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0018",
      "source_sha256": "cdbfb8c804c5bd30",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You will rejoice if you hear that they have gone to places where demons are consulted,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0019",
      "source_sha256": "c48b95115d6e51df",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because you yourself worship and serve the creation rather than the one who created everything, Jesus, who is blessed forever and ever,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0020",
      "source_sha256": "0be92a241a86750c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "rather than hear or see them going before God in every place where he is invoked, blessing him and giving him glory."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0021",
      "source_sha256": "26bfa249ce7a0924",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or if even more than the crowds of whom you said, “They bring him things,”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0022",
      "source_sha256": "6fae6455a8df76ba",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "if they pour out gifts for me without stint—since I too am rightly their servant, because they are my brothers, gathering up for them into treasures in heaven the things they give to honor God—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0023",
      "source_sha256": "d81e6837dda67157",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "were these things brought out of your house and your ancestors’ house?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0024",
      "source_sha256": "8e2b8c57b68d2ebc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You seize things that are not yours, you wicked man!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0025",
      "source_sha256": "cb5a9e45d07d8b03",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But you, for your part, act wickedly and put obstacles in the way of those who give to the poor."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0026",
      "source_sha256": "51a4a88bf07a980f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They know that the things they give, or use to show mercy to those in need, belong to Christ, who gave them to them to enjoy and to become rich in good works."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0027",
      "source_sha256": "9aa9bd23ce7118a8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Am I, then, still sitting on top of your head,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0028",
      "source_sha256": "b9462c1bb048d860",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that you say, “How long will he go on without sailing?” while he says, “I will go,” putting it off day after day?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0029",
      "source_sha256": "f93623ffa89d08f8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Why am I such a great burden on you in all this,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0030",
      "source_sha256": "c7c2b195ae03a402",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "whether I have gone to the kings or have not gone?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0031",
      "source_sha256": "aa7709c2c9626163",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not heaven and earth and everything in them belong to Christ?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0032",
      "source_sha256": "2d4217429493a793",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Does your father Cronus himself have anything at all except sins, which you and those like you cultivate for him?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0033",
      "source_sha256": "5e685c4201c8c6d6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You sow and gather in for him unbelief, lies, acts of violence, blasphemies, and every evil deed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0034",
      "source_sha256": "d14986347569910c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If you were a weed like this, growing by yourself, it would be right to tolerate you until harvesttime, according to the word of the Lord whom you have blasphemed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0035",
      "source_sha256": "e4b120fb2dbad513",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But you are a thorn and a thistle on the roads, an obstacle to those who walk there. That is why it is right to cut you down and pull up your root."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0036",
      "source_sha256": "0fdae01f5d890108",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And since you also said in your leprous words,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0037",
      "source_sha256": "a09b635fe31a85e3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“If he were really a monk, he would not have committed three murders during the forty days,”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0038",
      "source_sha256": "8d6bef68d009f78d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "calling the pigs and the cow that I slaughtered in the pagans’ houses “murders,”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0039",
      "source_sha256": "ff5b2e72052a975a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I, for my part, will say this in response to your twisted words:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0040",
      "source_sha256": "85b391d8e2b1dffd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If what I did was improper because I publicly exposed idol worshipers, then how great is your condemnation for breaking the observance of the forty days,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0041",
      "source_sha256": "ea38a9fa426b981f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and of the great and holy Easter, which everyone observes, even the God-loving kings!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0042",
      "source_sha256": "a3623ab7204bacfd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But you make your cooks work for you during it, living in luxury and deceiving without fear, and making others deceive along with you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0043",
      "source_sha256": "94a0e2c16ab0c489",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again, since you sent word to me,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0044",
      "source_sha256": "62441e6d862b5402",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Come and search my houses to see whether you find an idol in them,”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0045",
      "source_sha256": "213c036055c289a6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "when I searched it on another occasion—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0046",
      "source_sha256": "cb47f727ac4b1df0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "your house—I found no idol in it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0047",
      "source_sha256": "61fd080ce8753e3d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or do you have no others besides those I took away?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0048",
      "source_sha256": "af778a3c8070ed05",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or if I remove the idols in your house, will I also be able to hide the sun in the sky, the moon, and the stars that you worship?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0049",
      "source_sha256": "a77957940bb7e7e1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or shall I build walls at the places where they set, to stop you from praying toward the west?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0050",
      "source_sha256": "3dfa1e9ec64dbe43",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or shall I keep watch over the river and your canals to prevent you from pouring libations to Cronus into the donkeys’ urine?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0051",
      "source_sha256": "7ed3ac99fba206c7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Stop, then, saying these lying and deceitful words,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0052",
      "source_sha256": "303368c258836cd6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you man bent on great evils."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0053",
      "source_sha256": "8f5db7563c0a4848",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For just as you are godless, so you oppress the poor through your acts of violence."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0054",
      "source_sha256": "f182afb2b0d74fdc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or is this not another kind of persecution, your pursuing people, especially the elders of the church,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0055",
      "source_sha256": "311bae268ebae1e3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "until you drive them out of their houses, even at this time of great hardships upon the land, entering their properties,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0056",
      "source_sha256": "71d8b5f3dee69ee6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "with neither son nor father nor any of them there at all, because they have fled?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0057",
      "source_sha256": "4af7e903c0679ca1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You take their livestock, their carts, and their straw, and bring them to your gardens, forcing them to go around them beyond their strength."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0058",
      "source_sha256": "2fa6ea278dcf620a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And what about the great Passover? You do not give them time to celebrate it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0059",
      "source_sha256": "d48e845664073855",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You even make them launch the new boats you have built into the water on that day, instead of mourning on it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0060",
      "source_sha256": "84153e96ca71fae9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You have made them shout for joy against their will."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0061",
      "source_sha256": "36040e45dda2c85f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Who can recount all your evil deeds?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0062",
      "source_sha256": "d99a29173bbe67c0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Likewise, you slaughter your ox when it is about to die, or when it becomes worn out and is no longer useful for your work,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0063",
      "source_sha256": "79321cf9562cda76",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and divide it into portions however you please, imposing it on them—even on the widows, the old men and women, the orphans, and the strangers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0064",
      "source_sha256": "b868d8827d146594",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You demand money from them beyond what the portions are worth, until you have collected twice the price of the ox for very little of it: bones and useless things."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0065",
      "source_sha256": "c200f56f5a2a8f57",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Likewise, you give them calves and cows in turn to raise until they are full-grown, and then you take them away."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0066",
      "source_sha256": "2007d049ea0e6d79",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Some they must give you as a tribute, while you do nothing good for them in return."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0067",
      "source_sha256": "411bd9ee4193c9e4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Others they must likewise raise for you: horses, donkeys, sheep, calves, and pigs."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0068",
      "source_sha256": "734acc7cfbf632a9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If only you would stop at that!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0069",
      "source_sha256": "5df8c00bc5fae34c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For whatever you desire among their livestock,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0070",
      "source_sha256": "44dd7d2e5f744d54",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "or, for that matter, any other possessions,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0071",
      "source_sha256": "01f8dfef95313ffd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you seize from them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0072",
      "source_sha256": "4b8c13b9c34de921",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "some for nothing,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0073",
      "source_sha256": "d668ab502f19ca0d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "others for a small price,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0074",
      "source_sha256": "b3d50cf7b194820d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "apart from bread, wine, food, and straw."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0075",
      "source_sha256": "7ab4c96872d6dae6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and barley for your livestock, and everything else."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0076",
      "source_sha256": "9f78d1eb95950887",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Just as you also gather them to guard you on the boats when you flee from the barbarians."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0077",
      "source_sha256": "43c01fe7ea3a4a27",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or are they not the ones the barbarian is pursuing?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0078",
      "source_sha256": "22bac52b81c957f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Their wives and children and their meager provisions are on their livestock"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0079",
      "source_sha256": "a6f16adcf3a8889c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and in their carts, as they too flee from their own places to other places to save themselves."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0080",
      "source_sha256": "0e038b557d8222e1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is how many of them hire people for wages and send them to you to guard you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0081",
      "source_sha256": "9f5c5953404e71ce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And you do not stop at these things."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0082",
      "source_sha256": "8877e9b12be877ee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Instead, you keep adding to your acts of oppression."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0083",
      "source_sha256": "f89f985f5acf73ee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Just as you also exact from some of them a jar of wheat per household,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0084",
      "source_sha256": "1d5e1400ecafbf00",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because they have many people; from others twenty-five measures, and from others an artaba,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0085",
      "source_sha256": "618861a75c1308e8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "on the pretext of dancing in granaries."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0086",
      "source_sha256": "c1f051a9eb4423a6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They weep, saying, “We do not want to dance."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0087",
      "source_sha256": "2d334620892a1302",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "We have no bread to eat."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0088",
      "source_sha256": "c9007d1cb7e2cd37",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Things like this are not our concern,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0089",
      "source_sha256": "2b7732d0b0930f90",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "while our children are hungry and naked.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0090",
      "source_sha256": "801a0514fa9b6d9d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Most of them testify, “We do not dance in granaries.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0091",
      "source_sha256": "6daef83042ce1706",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or are they not the ones who perform forced labor on them until they have built them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0092",
      "source_sha256": "8d091e8b84d9eae9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as well as the other buildings for which you make them perform forced labor?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0093",
      "source_sha256": "ec5978390bc82bec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or are the villages also estates?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0094",
      "source_sha256": "06da32a348016370",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Was it you who built their houses in them?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0095",
      "source_sha256": "7a67392e734f98fe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And these are the very hardships you inflict on them there, through your forced labor and the treading of your wine, and all the suffering you cause and your acts of oppression."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0096.s1",
      "source_sha256": "f6bd0c216c2f1790",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O people whom the voice threatens, saying, “Those who are contentious and disobey the truth but obey injustice—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0096.s2",
      "source_sha256": "e2291832729e190d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "wrath and anger and affliction and distress upon every human soul that does evil.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0097",
      "source_sha256": "0ade52e3556562ae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nevertheless, I will speak before you, God of hosts, the Almighty. Do not be angry at my foolishness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0098",
      "source_sha256": "4526ea875aa5ee87",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I know that you forget nothing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0099",
      "source_sha256": "a0d732c42709bd60",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "You are the one who spoke through your holy prophets before that man-eater Pharaoh, saying, “Let my people go,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0100",
      "source_sha256": "3589b5d409a35d1f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "so that they may serve me or celebrate a festival for me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0101",
      "source_sha256": "a36154d11dedf77b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "You are also the one who said through them, “Be still and know that I am God.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0102",
      "source_sha256": "268a91c5ffcd2fd9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Have compassion, then, on your people, you who are patient and whose mercy is great."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0103",
      "source_sha256": "7a40200429e4440c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Rescue them from the hands of those who oppress them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0104",
      "source_sha256": "d6f3a32a4cace822",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "as you did for your people Israel at that time, so that they may be still and know that there is no other God besides you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0105",
      "source_sha256": "a8ad9a8ae3b4e1c2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Or do you not see that the pagans, the nations, and the godless have been unable to know you because they have not desisted from their unfaithfulness [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0106",
      "source_sha256": "2faf5fdf1c13dffa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "and all their impurities?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0107",
      "source_sha256": "ddedd14a00976ea7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Put a stop, then, to every kind of lawlessness"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0108",
      "source_sha256": "e065c2b29f01b909",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "and every act of violence everywhere,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0109",
      "source_sha256": "6b8bc5775a756b54",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "removing them from those who suffer violence, from the farthest reaches of the earth to the ends of the inhabited world,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0110",
      "source_sha256": "e9fb389e2c67b12c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "so that those who know you may have the freedom to serve you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0111",
      "source_sha256": "e743115b875ff2ef",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "For they will not be able to serve you while also serving those who oppress them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0112",
      "source_sha256": "2b1fa5e0fd1983b9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "If you had not rescued your people Israel at that time from the hands of that lawless Nebuchadnezzar"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0113",
      "source_sha256": "27ffc6887b4d6084",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "and all the others like him who afflicted them when you handed them over to them because you were angry with them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0114",
      "source_sha256": "762b5c46083119ac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "then, even though they sought you in that place, they would not have been able to sing your praises as they wished,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0115",
      "source_sha256": "a4f8a57c1c8796a0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "because they had no freedom amid their enslavement to so many tasks."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0116",
      "source_sha256": "db326c271dcc1474",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "As they said, “How can we sing the song of the Lord’s house in a foreign land?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0117",
      "source_sha256": "58507a8f83da02a0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Likewise, if you do not rescue those who suffer violence from the hands of these merciless people,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0118",
      "source_sha256": "6e31d5615cfe2ac8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "even though they call upon your name and also long to do your will because you are their hope,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0119",
      "source_sha256": "13781a84e645196f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "they will not be able to fulfill their vows to you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0120",
      "source_sha256": "c8045b8d57e23e7e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "with praises, prayers, and fasts, because they have no freedom to act uprightly, owing to their enslavement to the tasks imposed by these people who constantly plot evil against them."
